nywhere, which makes them very _______.',1.00,1,'2025-06-30 01:32:52','2026-01-06 11:34:40'),(499,47,3,'Because they can connect to the ______, you can use them to search for information, send emails, and watch videos.',1.00,1,'2025-06-30 01:33:18','2026-01-06 11:35:22'),(500,47,3,'For ICT students, they are helpful for learning about ______, fixing problems, and using software. Another good point is that these devices have many apps.',1.00,1,'2025-06-30 01:33:46','2026-01-06 11:36:37'),(501,47,3,'Another good point is that these devices have many apps. In case you need to study, there are apps for writing, drawing, or programming. They are also good for  ______, like making calls, sending messages, or having video meetings.',1.00,1,'2025-06-30 01:36:37','2026-01-06 11:36:54'),(502,47,3,'However, there are some problems with mobile phones and tablets. The battery does not last long unless you charge them often. Also, they are not as powerful as  _______or desktop computers, so they might be slow for heavy tasks like creating big programs.',1.00,1,'2025-06-30 01:37:06','2026-01-06 11:37:10'),(503,47,3,'These devices can also distract people. Because of social ________and games, some students may spend too much time on them and not study enough.',1.00,1,'2025-06-30 01:37:33','2026-01-06 11:37:23'),(504,47,3,'In addition, mobile phones and tablets can be expensive to buy and repair, which can be a problem for students with limited _________.',1.00,1,'2025-06-30 01:37:56','2026-01-06 11:37:37'),(505,47,3,'In conclusion, mobile phones and tablet computers are very helpful for ICT students. They are ______and useful for studying and communication. However, they can be expensive and may distract people. To use them well, it is important to focus on learning and not waste time.',1.00,1,'2025-06-30 01:38:19','2026-01-06 11:40:01'),(537,51,3,'The writer and her friend visited was near the sea. \r\n.....',1.00,1,'2025-12-29 18:31:42','2026-01-01 21:10:01'),(538,51,3,'The journ