:25:31'),(756,70,3,'Employers often value international experience when choosing new employees.',1.00,1,'2026-01-02 13:19:35','2026-01-06 12:25:46'),(757,70,3,'Choose the correct heading for paragraph 1.',2.00,1,'2026-01-02 13:20:28','2026-01-06 12:25:59'),(758,70,3,'Choose the correct heading for paragraph 2',2.00,1,'2026-01-02 13:20:55','2026-01-06 12:26:13'),(759,70,3,'Choose the correct heading for paragraph 3.',2.00,1,'2026-01-02 13:21:24','2026-01-06 12:26:49'),(760,70,3,'Choose the correct heading for paragraph 4.',2.00,1,'2026-01-02 13:21:57','2026-01-06 12:29:47'),(761,70,3,'Choose the correct heading for paragraph 5.',2.00,1,'2026-01-02 13:22:40','2026-01-06 12:30:03'),(762,70,3,'Studying abroad is a valuable experience for many university students because it supports both personal and academic  ________________ .',2.00,1,'2026-01-02 13:23:52','2026-01-06 12:31:20'),(763,70,3,'Living in a foreign country allows students to learn about different cultures, traditions, and daily habits, which helps them become more ______________ and adaptable. As students manage life away from home, they develop independence, confidence, and problem-solving skills.',2.00,1,'2026-01-02 13:24:38','2026-01-06 12:31:37'),(764,70,3,'Another major benefit of studying abroad is the improvement of language skills. Using a foreign language in real-life situations every day helps students communicate more naturally and ______________________ .',2.00,1,'2026-01-02 13:25:27','2026-01-06 12:31:54'),(765,70,3,'Academically, students benefit from new courses, modern facilities, and different teaching styles, which _______________________  critical thinking and better study habits.',2.00,1,'2026-01-02 13:26:06','2026-01-06 12:32:22'),(766,70,3,'Finally, studying abroad strengthens future career prospects, as employers value international experience, strong communication skills, and the ability to work in  _______________  environments.',2.00,1,'2026-01-02 13:26:41','2026-01-06 12:32:39'),(7