 19:58:16','2026-01-06 11:55:42'),(783,71,3,'Everything contained in a website …',1.00,1,'2026-01-03 19:59:08','2026-01-06 11:55:53'),(784,71,3,'How easily a user can use a website …',1.00,1,'2026-01-03 19:59:32','2026-01-06 11:56:08'),(785,71,3,'How easily you can find a website on a search engine __________________',1.00,1,'2026-01-03 19:59:55','2026-01-06 11:56:19'),(786,71,3,'Unwanted advertising emails are popularly known as __________.',1.00,1,'2026-01-03 20:01:17','2026-01-06 11:57:30'),(787,72,3,'Pros and Cons of Mobile Phones and Tablet Computers\r\nMobile phones and tablet computers are very 1. _________today, especially for people who study or work in ICT.',1.00,1,'2026-01-03 20:02:15','2026-01-06 11:58:35'),(788,72,3,'They are useful tools, but they also have some 2________.',1.00,1,'2026-01-03 20:02:40','2026-01-06 11:58:45'),(789,72,3,'Mobile phones and tablets are easy to carry because they are small and light. You can take them anywhere, which makes them very 3_______.',1.00,1,'2026-01-03 20:03:08','2026-01-06 11:58:56'),(790,72,3,'Because they can connect to the 4.______, you can use them to search for information, send emails, and watch videos.',1.00,1,'2026-01-03 20:03:49','2026-01-06 11:59:06'),(791,72,3,'For ICT students, they are helpful for learning about 5.______, fixing problems, and using software. Another good point is that these devices have many apps. In case you need to study, there are apps for writing, drawing, or programming.',1.00,1,'2026-01-03 20:04:43','2026-01-06 11:59:18'),(792,72,3,'They are also good for 6. ______, like making calls, sending messages, or having video meetings.',1.00,1,'2026-01-03 20:05:19','2026-01-06 11:59:33'),(793,72,3,'However, there are some problems with mobile phones and tablets. The battery does not last long unless you charge them often. Also, they are not as powerful as 7. _______or desktop computers, so they might be slow for heavy tasks like creating big programs. These devices can also distract pe